Ghostty and libghostty-vt
https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty
Copyright (c) 2024 Mitchell Hashimoto, Ghostty contributors
Licensed under the MIT License (licenses/ghostty-LICENSE-MIT)

All terminal emulation is Ghostty's: libghostty-vt (tag vt-1.0.1, commit
108cacb17ed8990840cd14abfce43d8ed8503ca1) is built from source and linked.
The core library's renderer logic (cell metrics, colour resolution, shaping
runs, cursor and decoration rules, image ordering and sprite glyphs) is
ported from Ghostty's renderer and font code at the same commit. See
docs/PROVENANCE.md for the exact files.

Libraries that Ghostty statically links into libghostty-vt carry their own
notices in licenses/ (see licenses/README.md).

