herdr (herdr-app)
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
Copyright the herdr contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (licenses/herdr-app-LICENSE-APACHE)

herdr-app showed how to render libghostty-vt terminals with a UI toolkit's
own text and quad primitives, and how to build and bind libghostty-vt from
Rust. The Rust bindings and the GPUI component in this repository are derived
from herdr-app at commit a2e8e3ffa84439d4a245a1e6aa8947ef0dd20a1b. Each derived
file states that it was modified; docs/PROVENANCE.md lists the files and the
changes.

